                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3e0cc5ee-3b92-3cc7-a72b-289a367345da",
                        "entry_id": "147fdd99-fa39-3aed-9a4d-74539a0218a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Covered or darkened as with a cloud; overclouded; obscured."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2dee122d-e1c6-4c3e-a979-6614cfc3522c",
                                "sense_id": "3e0cc5ee-3b92-3cc7-a72b-289a367345da",
                                "text": "[B]ot sen I the to hir cure vassaill:\n [To mak the r]efrane, my power laikis haill.\n [For] in hir net thow art obnubilate:\n [Gif] thow conuert, and tak my trew counsall\n […]eng or lust thow suld neuer assaill.\n […]waill hart fra hir to sequestrate,\n […] time sa far as is fustrate:\n […]oir repent, and thow sall ȝit preuaill."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30f9bbd4-7f64-47b8-9744-0b05e81f40b0",
                                "sense_id": "3e0cc5ee-3b92-3cc7-a72b-289a367345da",
                                "text": "And that ſame ὁρμὴ, that violent motion vnto action…is it not that that effecteth thoſe ſtrange and horrible acts of madneſſe when the reaſon & ſence are both beſotted and obnubilate?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c19cc424-4ceb-435a-b68c-d8f51995ba67",
                                "sense_id": "3e0cc5ee-3b92-3cc7-a72b-289a367345da",
                                "text": "Mans vnderstanding’s so obnubilate,\n That when thereon I doe excogitate,\n Intrinsicall and querimonious paines\n Doe puluerise the concaue of my braines."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c46094c-7384-491b-9f57-0401e2579033",
                                "sense_id": "3e0cc5ee-3b92-3cc7-a72b-289a367345da",
                                "text": "Here is the sample of [Whitman’s] obnubilate, incoherent, convulsive flub-drub."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
